          "canonical_hash": "sha256:3e63e1820a783371f9c6d966c588fe944292d3e85b3e812ecd5b9b48357f99da",
          "description": "Whether a router model still ships a universal default password, the pattern prohibited for consumer connectable products under the UK PSTI Act and targeted by the EU Cyber Resilience Act, based on the manufacturer-cited credential type, with the ssid.ai Router Compliance Index totals for context. Pass the ssid.ai slug (get it from get_router_defaults). Documentation reading, not legal advice.",
